Red-black trees with their well-formedness, depth and lemma files.

Source, under Apache License 2.0:
  https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries-recycling
  revision b655c13f6e99c9dd1216ffce7c53afbd520553d7

Batteries moved these modules out of Batteries.Recycling.RBTree into that
repository on 2026-10-05. Mathlib v4.36.0's Batteries no longer has them;
Transformer.ALM.TreeQuery and Transformer.ALM.TreeBalance need them.

RBTree/Basic.lean, WF.lean, Depth.lean, Alter.lean and Lemmas.lean are the
import closure of RBTree.Depth and RBTree.Lemmas, copied without change. The
repository's MonadSatisfying library and RBTree.lean are not included.
Copyright and author notices in the source files are retained. The sources
rely on auto-bound implicit arguments and universes, so unlike this
repository's other libraries, RBTree keeps Lean's default `autoImplicit`.
